{"seq":2,"slug":"middle-dialogues","title":"Middle Dialogues","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-republic-work","title":"《理想国》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues/the-republic-work","wordCount":1759,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"phaedo-and-symposium","title":"《斐多》《会饮》《斐德罗》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/major-works/middle-dialogues/phaedo-and-symposium","wordCount":1822,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章考察柏拉图中期的杰作，它们标志着柏拉图哲学的成熟与辉煌。《理想国》以\"正义\"为核心，融汇了柏拉图几乎全部的核心思想，是其集大成之作；《斐多篇》论灵魂不朽，《会饮篇》论爱（\"爱的阶梯\"），《斐德罗篇》论灵魂与修辞——这三篇既是深刻的哲学著作，又是优美的文学杰作。本章呈现柏拉图中期哲学思想与艺术的双重巅峰。\n"}